@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@tradeId = {{createTrade.response.body.$.id}}

### 1. GET daftar trade -> 200 (array kosong saat backend baru berjalan)
GET {{baseUrl}}/trades

### 2. POST tambah trade -> 201; jalankan sebelum request dengan @tradeId
# @name createTrade
POST {{baseUrl}}/trades
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tanggal": "2026-11-15",
  "pair": "XAUUSD",
  "posisi": "Buy",
  "lotSize": 0.1,
  "hasil": "Win",
  "profitLoss": 150,
  "catatan": "Entry sesuai trading plan.",
  "sesuaiRencana": true
}

### 3. GET daftar setelah tambah -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/trades

### 4. GET detail -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/trades/{{tradeId}}

### 5. PATCH sebagian field -> 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/trades/{{tradeId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hasil": "Loss",
  "profitLoss": -50,
  "catatan": "Evaluasi: stop loss tersentuh.",
  "sesuaiRencana": false
}

### 6. Validasi DTO -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/trades
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tanggal": "2026-11-15",
  "pair": "!",
  "posisi": "Buy",
  "lotSize": 0,
  "hasil": "Win",
  "profitLoss": 150,
  "sesuaiRencana": "ya"
}

### 7. Aturan bisnis hasil/P&L -> 400 BadRequestException
POST {{baseUrl}}/trades
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tanggal": "2026-11-15",
  "pair": "XAUUSD",
  "posisi": "Buy",
  "lotSize": 0.1,
  "hasil": "Win",
  "profitLoss": -50
}

### 8. ID tidak ada -> 404 NotFoundException
GET {{baseUrl}}/trades/tidak-ada

### 9. Field asing ditolak ValidationPipe -> 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/trades/{{tradeId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "id-dari-client"
}

### 10. DELETE -> 204 tanpa body
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/trades/{{tradeId}}

### 11. GET data yang sudah dihapus -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/trades/{{tradeId}}

### 12. GET daftar setelah hapus -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/trades
